{"availability":"available","full":"HelgeSverre/ollama-gui","name":"ollama-gui","description":"A Web Interface for chatting with your local LLMs via the ollama API","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":1257,"forks":162,"created":"2023-10-08T10:59:03Z","updated":"2026-10-06T06:27:54Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ollama-gui.vercel.app/","topics":["ai","chat-ui","gui","llm","local-llm","ollama","privacy","self-hosted","typescript","vue"],"demo":"https://ollama-gui.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T22:35:07.956Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T22:35:07.956Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T22:35:07.956Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T22:35:07.956Z","stars":1257,"forks":162}],"technologies":["Vue"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A web interface for chatting with local models through Ollama.","Ollama GUI is a single-page app that talks directly to the Ollama API from your browser. There is no backend of its own: chats are stored in the browser's IndexedDB and never leave your machine except to reach the Ollama server you point it at."],"features":["Chat: streaming replies that you can stop, regenerate or edit. Edits and regenerations are kept as versions you can switch between, and any reply can be branched into a new chat.","Thinking models such as qwen3, deepseek-r1 and gpt-oss: the reasoning is shown in a collapsible block, and you can turn thinking on or off (or set the effort level for gpt-oss).","Attachments: images for vision models (llava, gemma3), and text or code files, which are added to the message.","Models: search the Ollama library as you type and pick a size, then pull with progress. Also delete, inspect capabilities and context length, and unload models from memory.","Settings: system prompt and generation parameters (temperature, numctx, topp, seed and others), set globally, per model or per chat."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HelgeSverre/ollama-gui/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e7a7b7ef62eede65e7e659f3f734c7e072b3e89d464a77490c7f7f7da2ef8f1a","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T22:35:08.077Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T22:35:08.077Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A web interface for chatting with local models through Ollama.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HelgeSverre/ollama-gui/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"e7a7b7ef62eede65e7e659f3f734c7e072b3e89d464a77490c7f7f7da2ef8f1a","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HelgeSverre/ollama-gui/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T22:35:08.078Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-06T06:27:54Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HelgeSverre/ollama-gui/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T22:35:08.078Z","hash":"e7a7b7ef62eede65e7e659f3f734c7e072b3e89d464a77490c7f7f7da2ef8f1a","originalBytes":7338,"storedBytes":7338,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["ollama","run","bun","app","build","api","bash","browser","chats","models","dev","docker","gui","origin","pull","settings","url","another","chat","data","local","ollama-gui","origins","search","server","set","test","vite","ctrl","e2e","forwards","machine","model","new","nginx","only","own","port","serve","site","start","stored","access","against","any","ask","block","built","chat.","code","coverage","default","delete","devices","dist","enter","export","follow","ghcr.io","gpt-oss","helgesverre","host","hosted","images","import","indexeddb","instead","katex","library","message","network","never","ollama.","one","per","proxy","qwen3","reach","real","runs","same","stop","talks","thinking","uses","using","version","vision","where","which","able","access.","action","add-host","added","address","allow","allow.","always","amd64","appearance","apps","archiving","arm64","arrange","at.","attachment","attachments","backend","bar.","behind","between","box","branched","browser.","capabilities","catalog","change","chatting","c